ChatDataset: pass tool-call ``arguments`` to the chat template as a mapping.

Upstream json.dumps() dict arguments into strings before templating. Templates
that iterate ``arguments|items`` (Qwen3.5) raise "Can only get item pairs from a
mapping" on a string, and ``arguments | tojson`` templates (Nemotron) would
double-encode it. vLLM json.loads() OpenAI-style string arguments before it
applies the template, so training on mappings also matches serving. JSON object
strings are decoded; invalid JSON and non-object JSON pass through unchanged.

Drop this patch once the pinned Automodel commit includes the change.

